<description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
* New: Open URL… (⌘U) plays an audio file from a web address, including Dropbox and Google Drive share links
* New: drop a web link on the player to play it
* New: automatic updates, and Check for Updates in the Vibe menu
* New: Cut and Paste in the Edit menu
* Improved: the pitch fader sounds cleaner and glides instead of stepping
* Fixed: a network share that stops answering now pauses with "Connection lost" instead of going silent
]]></description>
